      "candidateRole": "You are the podiatrist.",
      "patientRole": "A 57-year-old woman with long-standing rheumatoid arthritis, subluxed metatarsal heads, clawed toes and callus beneath the forefoot that has twice broken down. Her daughter marries in seven weeks and she has bought heeled shoes for the day.",
