      "setting": "Community podiatry clinic, at an urgent appointment.",
      "candidateRole": "You are the podiatrist.",
      "patientRole": "A 64-year-old man whose plantar ulcer healed nine months ago after a year of treatment. It has recurred at the same site, 9 mm across, clean and uninfected. He has done everything he was asked to do.",
