      "candidateRole": "You are the radiographer.",
      "patientRole": "A 64-year-old man booked for an MRI of the lumbar spine. He is wearing a metal neck chain that his late wife gave him and that he has not taken off in thirty-one years. He is refusing to remove it and says it can stay on under his gown.",
