      "candidateRole": "You are the speech and language therapist.",
      "patientRole": "A 74-year-old man three weeks after a stroke, with an unsafe swallow for thin fluids. He has tried the thickened drinks, describes them as undrinkable, and says he would rather take his chances. He is alert and fully orientated.",
